      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about DEFAULT_FALLBACK_HTTPS_URL to align with names used for the HTTP fallback URLs ?\n\n\"Default\" with the other constants indicates that they can be overridden through a global setting. We should probably support this for the fallback HTTPS URL too. How about creating a CAPTIVE_PORTAL_FALLBACK_HTTPS_URL setting and adding a getCaptivePortalFallbackHttpsUrl() method ?\nI\u0027d also consider supporting a comma-separated list of URLs and reusing logic in makeCaptivePortalFallbackUrls() and nextFallbackUrl(). This would avoid future issues that could lead to the current situation with HTTP fallback URLs, where we have two CAPTIVE_PORTAL_FALLBACK_URL and CAPTIVE_PORTAL_OTHER_FALLBACK_URLS settings.",
